      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Three_Lakes%2C_Michigan",
      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "US 41, M‑28, and the Lakes State Connector travel east–west right through the heart of Three Lakes.",
